# Modeling — EmONC Curriculum Tracking

**Pipeline:** Kobo (EmONC Curriculum Tracking Form) → Airbyte → ClickHouse → dbt → Power BI  
**Target fact grain:** one row per `submission_id × mentee_id × mentorship_activity × topic`  
**Canonical BI table:** `mart_emonc_curriculum_tracking` (replaces / feeds `mentors.mentee_curriculum_tracking`)

This document ports the existing mentee curriculum tracking transformation framework
(Power Query / Apps Script activities log / `handle_mentee_curriculum_tracking`) into a
layered dbt model for ClickHouse.

Framework references used while the shared sheet was not readable from this environment:

- [Transformation framework sheet](https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1WOKBC1VCzNt7oXcRxd_5NfamZab6S_NLOZZjXVHF1T0/edit?gid=0#gid=0)
- `Mentors_tables_processing.md` → `handle_mentee_curriculum_tracking`
- `EmONC_Curriculum_Activities_Log_Transformation.js` (Power Query topic display maps)
- EmONC Curriculum Tracking Form 2026 survey/choices (`emonc_activities` + per-activity topics)

---

## 1. Architecture

```text
┌─────────────┐    Airbyte     ┌──────────────────────┐
│ Kobo CTF    │ ─────────────► │ ClickHouse raw       │
│ submissions │   (JSON/flat)  │ airbyte.*            │
└─────────────┘                └──────────┬───────────┘
                                          │
                     dbt staging (views)  ▼
                               stg_airbyte__emonc_curriculum_tracking
                                          │
                  dbt intermediate (tables)▼
                               int_emonc_curriculum_activity_rows
                               int_emonc_facility_inattendance
                                          │
                       dbt marts (gold)   ▼
                               mart_emonc_curriculum_tracking   ◄── Power BI fact
                               mart_emonc_facility_inattendance
                                          │
                                          ▼  (existing completion pipeline)
                               mart_emonc_curriculum_completion
```

| Layer | Materialization | Role |
|-------|-----------------|------|
| **staging** | `view` | Rename / cast / light clean of Airbyte columns; 1 row ≈ 1 Kobo submission |
| **intermediate** | `table` | Business logic: parse mentees, facilities, activities↔topics; explode to fact grain |
| **marts** | `table` (`+schema: gold`) | Stable BI contracts for Power BI |

