## 2. Source contract (Airbyte → ClickHouse)

Declare the raw stream once Airbyte lands Kobo CTF data. Column names vary by Airbyte
normalization; resolve with the same `resolve_column` pattern used for mentees.

```yaml
# models/staging/airbyte/_airbyte__sources.yml  (add)
sources:
  - name: airbyte
    schema: "{{ var('airbyte_schema', 'default') }}"
    tables:
      - name: emonc_curriculum_tracking
        identifier: EmONC_Curriculum_Tracking   # confirm DESCRIBE after first sync
        description: >
          Raw Kobo EmONC Curriculum Tracking Form submissions loaded by Airbyte.
          Prefer JSON/_airbyte_data if the connector lands nested payloads;
          otherwise flattened slash-path columns from Kobo.
```

### Expected Kobo field families (multi-schema tolerant)

| Concept | Candidate keys / prefixes |
|---------|---------------------------|
| Submission id | `_id`, `_uuid` |
| Submitted at | `_submission_time` |
| Session date | `demographic_information/mentor_details/session_date`, `session_date`, … |
| Mentor name | `demographic_information/mentor_details/mentor_name`, `mentor/name`, … |
| County | `demographic_information/facility_details/county`, `…/mentee_details/county`, … |
| Facility | `…/facility_details/*_facilities`, `…/q_facility_*`, … |
| Mentees | `demographic_information/mentee_details*/`* `*_mentees` values `id_name` space-separated |
| Activities | `emonc_training_curriculum/emonc_curriculum_activities/emonc_activities` (space-separated) |
| Topics by activity | see activity → topic key map below |
| Inattendance | `group_mo8aa12/Reasons_for_inattendance` (and mentor_checklist variants) |

### Activity → topic key map (framework)

| Activity code (`mentorship_activity`) | Topic field suffix(es) |
|---------------------------------------|------------------------|
| `cmes` | `cmes` |
| `videos` | `videos` |
| `case_scenarios` | `case_scenarios` |
| `video_case_scenarios` / `videoa_case_scenarios` | `video_scenarios` (normalize activity → `video_case_scenarios`) |
| `skill_demos_mentor` | `mentor_skills_demo` |
| `skills_demos_mentee` | `mentee_skills_return_demo` |
| `drills` | `drills` |

Topic prefixes to search: `emonc_training_curriculum/`, `group_activities/`,
`mentor/group_activities/`, `mentor_checklist/mentor/group_ek78v70/`, `group_ek78v70/`.

**Critical rule (do not cartesian):** for each selected activity, only explode topics from
that activity’s topic field. Never cross all topics with all activities on a submission.

