## 5. Marts (Power BI ready)

### 5.1 Primary fact — curriculum activity log

```sql
-- models/marts/mart_emonc_curriculum_tracking.sql
-- BI grain: one mentee-activity-topic credit per submission
-- Column names aligned with mentors.mentee_curriculum_tracking for drop-in Power BI.

select
    submission_id,
    submitted_at as date_submitted,
    session_date,
    mentor_name,
    county,
    toString(facility_code) as facility_code,
    facility,
    mentee_id,
    mentee_name,
    mentorship_activity,
    topic_code,
    topic,
    -- Helpful for Power BI relationships / integrity scoring
    toDate(submitted_at) as submission_date,
    dateDiff('day', session_date, toDate(submitted_at)) as days_session_to_submit
from {{ ref('int_emonc_curriculum_activity_rows') }}
where mentee_id is not null
```

YAML:

```yaml
models:
  - name: mart_emonc_curriculum_tracking
    description: >
      EmONC curriculum activity fact for Power BI. Grain =
      submission × mentee × mentorship_activity × topic.
    columns:
      - name: submission_id
        data_tests: [not_null]
      - name: mentee_id
        data_tests: [not_null]
      - name: mentorship_activity
        data_tests:
          - not_null
          - accepted_values:
              arguments:
                values:
                  - cmes
                  - videos
                  - case_scenarios
                  - video_case_scenarios
                  - skill_demos_mentor
                  - skills_demos_mentee
                  - drills
      - name: topic
        data_tests: [not_null]
      - name: date_submitted
        data_tests: [not_null]
```

Suggested uniqueness test (composite):

```yaml
