## 8. Framework ↔ dbt step map

| Transformation framework step | dbt layer | Model |
|------------------------------|-----------|-------|
| Load Kobo submissions | source | `source('airbyte','emonc_curriculum_tracking')` |
| Type / rename metadata | staging | `stg_airbyte__emonc_curriculum_tracking` |
| Parse mentor / county / facility / session date | intermediate | `int_emonc_curriculum_activity_rows` |
| Split mentees (`id_name`) | intermediate | same |
| Split activities; normalize `videoa_*` | intermediate | same |
| Pair activity → topic field; split topics | intermediate | same |
| Map topic codes → Power Query display names | intermediate + seed | `emonc_topic_label_map` |
| Skip activities without topics | intermediate | `where topic_code is not null` |
| Emit fact rows | mart | `mart_emonc_curriculum_tracking` |
| Inattendance reasons | intermediate → mart | `int_` / `mart_emonc_facility_inattendance` |
| Curriculum completion KPIs | existing marts | `mart_emonc_curriculum_completion` |
